    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present 16 Alderpark Court to the open market. An attractive 3 bedroom corner back to back house, situated in this highly sought after development of similar style homes, gated and situated off Old Blessington Road.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises hall, living/dining with gas fire, wood mantlepiece with marble inset and door to Kitchen with range of fitted units, sink unit and storage. Upstairs is landing with hot-press, Bathroom with w.c., whb, bath and Triton shower, 3 bedrooms with fitted wardrobes. Outside is spacious communal green area and parking.\r\n\r\nThe Alderpark Court development is conveniently located close to the Luas Red Line, Bus routes and M50. The location offers a wide selection of shops, cafes, restaurants and schools. It is in close proximity to Tallaght University Hospital, Technological University Dublin, The Square Tallaght and Tallaght Stadium."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nRecessed lights\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining\r\nWood Mantlepiece, gas fire, marble inset. Recessed lights. Doors to:\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\nRange of fitted units. Sink unit. Extractor. Tiled, part tiled. Storage. \r\n\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\nLanding\r\nHot press. Recessed lights.\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nW.c., whb. Bath with triton shower. Extractor. Tiled.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nFitted wardrobe. Storage shelving.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nFitted wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\nFitted wardrobe. Velux window.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\nSpacious and communal green space. Resident parking."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Secure development\r\nAlarm\r\nWalking distance to Luas Red Line and Bus Routes\r\nConvenient to M50 and City Centre\r\nClose proximity to Tallaght University Hospital, Technological University Dublin and Tallaght Stadium\r\nNearby to shops, restaurants, cafes including The Square Tallaght"
      },
